# Generated, not hand-written -- regenerated by scripts/generate_docs_index.py
# and scripts/generate_architecture_map.py (run automatically by
# apply_update()/update.sh on every update). Tracking these caused the
# exact same class of bug js/config.js did: the live-regenerated version
# never quite matches whatever was last committed, leaving the repo
# "dirty" after every single update and blocking the next one.
docs/index.md
docs/architecture-map.svg

